          'Applies a rate limit to cap the number of errors accepted during a given time window. To\ndisable entirely set `rateLimit` to null.\n```json\n{\n    "rateLimit": {\n        "window": 7200, // time in seconds\n        "count": 1000 // error cap\n    }\n}\n```',
        required: [],
